From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:42:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge gfx-options (port settings, overlay, renderer options)
 into the Vita line

Brings in:
* Port settings: one header for the section-7 keys, settings.txt load/save, overrides, restart rule
* Kernel: pause interface (PauseScope, request_pause/park, listeners), frozen clock in both modes
* Overlay menu model, canvas and bitmap font (host/overlay), with tests
* gl: shader sources for pixel lighting, FXAA, bicubic and the overlay
* gl: pixel lighting, FXAA, MSAA preview, smooth filter, mip chains, bicubic movie filter, overlay canvas, fps counter
* Settings overlay in the runtime: chord, modal loop under a kernel pause, pad filter; shader lint and cost tools
* gfx.movie_filter: a full-screen opaque low-res picture drawn by the GE gets the bicubic variant (kSharpen); a CPU-shown picture is enlarged lazily; ge_replay --clip-texture; pixel lighting cost High

